logic 0 reg 0: codes 0 0, returned 1
logic 1 reg 1: codes 1 1, returned 0
logic z reg z: codes 2 2, returned x
logic x reg x: codes 3 3, returned z
c_make: the inout reg had code 2
made from 0: l 0 r x
c_make: the inout reg had code 3
made from 1: l 1 r z
c_make: the inout reg had code 2
made from 2: l z r 1
c_make: the inout reg had code 1
made from 3: l x r 0
bit 0 and 1: codes 0 1
